{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:109290","original":"Main character in [[Bocchi the Rock!]]. Also known by her titular nickname \"Bocchi\", an introverted girl with an exceptional skill at playing [[guitar]]. She struggled to find any friends due to her social anxiety until she joined the Kessoku Band at the request of [[Ijichi Nijika]].\r\n\r\nShe has [[blue eyes]] and [[long hair|long]] [[pink hair]] with a [[one side up]], [[large breasts]] (according to ch. 4 of the manga)  & [[hair between eyes]] (sometimes depicted with [[hair over eyes]]). She usually wears a [[cube hair ornament]], a [[pink jacket|pink]] [[track jacket]], a [[grey skirt|grey]] [[pleated skirt]], [[black socks]], and [[brown footwear|brown]] [[loafers]]. Other times depicted wearing [[pink pants|pink]] [[track pants|track]] [[pants under skirt|pants under her skirt]]. She [[playing instrument|plays]] the [[Gibson Les Paul]] [[Electric Guitar]], which she is usually depicted [[holding instrument|holding]] or keeping in [[instrument case|guitar case]].\r\n\r\nShe is voiced by [[Aoyama Yoshino]] and portrayed by [[Morino Mamo]] in the stage-play.\r\n\r\nNot to be confused with [[Hitori Bocchi]] from [i][[Hitoribocchi no Marumaru Seikatsu]][/i].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #7506349\r\n* !post #8165071\r\n* !post #8587749: [[Gotoh Hitori (tsuchinoko)|Tsuchinoko]]\r\n* !post #6609730: [[Gotoh Hitori (octopus)|Octopus]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* \"Bocchi's Stress-induced Transformations\":[/pools/20401]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"gotoh_hitori"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:1964304","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/